    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/08-carp-like-fishes-2-barbs-minnows-carps-goldfish-etc/danionella_aff_mirifica_en/",
      "html": "<p>This fish is imported only rarely. These precious little fish need an aquarium of their own.</p>"
    },
    {
